---
import StudentPage from '../../components/StudentPage.astro';

const steps = ['Fast air', 'Flat chin', 'Tight corners', 'High tongue'];
---

<StudentPage
  title="Tips"
  description="Four steps to a great clarinet embouchure, from Rey Abolofia's teaching studio."
>
  <div class="tips">
    <section>
      <h2>Embouchure</h2>
      <ol class="steps" role="list">
        {
          steps.map((s, i) => (
            <li>
              <span class="n num">{i + 1}</span>
              <span>{s}</span>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ol>
    </section>

    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        Air is the most important piece of a good clarinet sound. It should be strong and fast, like a laser beam aimed
        toward the reed. Engage your abdominal muscles and push hard.
      </p>
      <p>The chin must be flat like a table and stretched downward as though it is reaching for your toes.</p>
      <p>
        The back of the tongue should be high in the mouth, as though you are saying the letter “E.” However the lips
        should be very circular and tight, as though you are saying the letter “O.”
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</StudentPage>

<style>
  .tips {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 5fr) minmax(0, 7fr);
    gap: clamp(32px, 6vw, 96px);
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: var(--fs-xl);
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }

  .steps {
    display: grid;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--paper-line);
  }

  .steps li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 20px;
    padding-block: 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--paper-line);
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 1.6rem;
  }

  .n {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: var(--fs-sm);
    color: var(--aubergine);
    width: 1.5em;
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .tips {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
